*   **Visual Grouping:** Keep related fields tightly stacked. Always place a `Text` label immediately before its corresponding `TextBox` or `SelectBox` so the user knows exactly what the input is for.
*   **Text Dividers & Spacing:** Use `Text("---")` or `Text("â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•â•")` to create horizontal lines that separate different functional zones (e.g., separating the list of parts from the "Update Purchase Status" tool). Use `Text("")` to inject empty vertical whitespace.
*   **Clear Headers:** Use the `Header("Section Name")` component to clearly title every distinct tool or page.
